CHANGES FROM ORIGINAL:

This is a refactored version for Redmine 6.x / Rails 7.2 compatibility.

Removed features:
- Email notification functionality
- wice_grid dependency (replaced with standard Redmine pagination)

Technical changes:
- alias_method_chain → prepend pattern
- before_filter → before_action
- attr_accessible → removed (Strong Parameters)
- unloadable → removed
- Plugin name changed to avoid conflict on redmine.org
